      "id": "map_national_status",
      "info": "One pin per registered asset, coloured by whichever question the tab above selects.\nNot every family answers every question, and a family that does not is left grey rather than dropped — a site missing from the map reads as a site that does not exist. Each mode's own note says which families it covers.\nCritical alerts are deliberately not a mode: the escalation endpoint pages at 100 rows and an overlay needs every id. The Critical Alerts card above counts them, and the All Alerts dashboard lists them.",
