        {
          "key": "operational",
          "label": "Operational status",
          "type": "option",
          "info": "Whether each site's latest monitoring found it working.\nEach family answers under its own question and option set: station_status on Pump Stations (operational / blocked / overflowing / not_operational), system_status on EPS (operational / issue_with_system), infrastructure_status on RWS (operational / non_operational). Anything not listed as functional counts as non-functional.\nWWTP and WTP have no plant-level status question on either monitoring form, so their sites are always grey. That is a gap in the forms, not a finding about those plants — see issue #34 G1.\nGrey also covers a site whose family asks the question but which has not been monitored yet. An unanswered status is not evidence of a fault, so it is never coloured as one.",
